      "writtenOn": "2019-02-17T12:12:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "tcpci_tcpm_get_cc() does not behave correct when we set the pull resistor (Rp or Rd) only to one CC line (as I explain in my comment on set_cc function), therefore we had to override it with this function.",
      "parentUuid": "e24afc39_3b2f1301",
