        "id": 1160634
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-02-17T12:12:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Please refer to the TCPC spec  Revision 2.0, Version 1.0, Figure 4-15 (TCPC State Diagram before a Connection).\nPOWER_CONTROL.AutoDischargeDisconnect must be set to 1 in order for the TCPC HW state machine to switch from MAINTAIN_STATE to Attached.Src or Attached.Snk. \nSo I agree that this is not the perfect place to do it , but it was done here since this bit (AutoDischargeDisconnect) is currently not handled at all by the google TCPM code.",
      "parentUuid": "07b614cd_29865d15",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 209,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 213,
        "endChar": 41
      },
