      "writtenOn": "2019-02-17T12:12:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Please note that our TCPC chip is compatible with spec  Revision 2.0, Version 1.0.\nTherefore all access to the Receive buffer data is through offset 0x30 (TCPC_REG_RX_BYTE_CNT)",
      "parentUuid": "4b386eda_65cc5ffb",
