      "message": "yes, I can tell that is compliant from the code.\n\n0x30 has the number of bytes\n0x31 starts the data\n\n\nYou already read the number of bytes on line 279, you don\u0027t need to read 0x30 again. You can start reading from 0x31 for cnt number of bytes.",
      "parentUuid": "f3648895_246002d7",
      "range": {
